---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="Site-use information for Truth to Live By. Editorial content supports general understanding and reflection."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">USING THIS SITE</span>
      <h1>
        A few shared
        <br />
        <em>understandings.</em>
      </h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose-page">
      <aside class="sample-note">
        <strong>Draft for owner review before launch.</strong>
      </aside>
      <h2>Editorial purpose</h2>
      <p>
        Truth to Live By explores ideas for general understanding and reflection. Content should be
        read in context, including its evidence notes and references. It does not provide individual
        professional advice.
      </p>
      <h2>Accuracy and corrections</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to treat sources fairly and distinguish evidence from interpretation. Ideas and
        information can change. Please use the <a href="/contact/">contact route</a> to flag a
        possible error, with a link and enough detail to examine it.
      </p>
      <h2>Content and attribution</h2>
      <p>
        Original site content and illustrations belong to their respective rights holders. A link to
        an article is welcome. Permission for substantial reuse, republication or commercial use
        should be arranged with the rights holder. Third-party material remains subject to its own
        terms.
      </p>
      <h2>External services</h2>
      <p>
        Third-party platforms, including linked social channels and any future newsletter service,
        operate under their own terms and privacy notices. Their availability is outside this
        website’s control.
      </p>
      <h2>Preview material</h2>
      <p>
        Essays marked as samples are editorial drafts supplied to review the website. They are not
        approved publication material. The website will not include them in its public build until
        the owner approves them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
